Source: https://github.com/sinelaw/fresh
Comment:
 Audited against the whole source tree (licensecheck, plus the history of
 every file that could be third-party); see debian/README.source. Besides
 the files listed below, everything is Fresh's own, contributed under
 GPL-3+, including:
 .
  * the Sublime syntax definitions under
    crates/fresh-editor-core/src/grammars/ other than those listed below,
    and the tree-sitter queries under crates/fresh-editor-core/queries/,
    written for Fresh;
  * the themes under crates/fresh-editor-core/themes/; the Dracula, Nord,
    Solarized, Gruvbox and Tokyo Night ones take their colour values from
    those palettes and contain nothing else from those projects;
  * screenshots, recordings, icons and other images (including
    crates/fresh-editor/scripts/landscape*.png and
    docs/public/images/nostalgia.jpeg), all created by Noam Lewis.

